\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Two distinct outcomes from step initial data connecting $u=u^+$ to $u=0$ plotted on even time steps $t \in \{0,2,4,...\}$. Left: with $a=0.1$, $r=0.23$, the solution converges to a stacked wave train consisting of a monostable $2$-periodic traveling wave connecting $\{u^+,u^-\}$ to $1$ followed by a monostable traveling wave connecting $1$ to $0$. Right: with $a=0.25$, $r=0.75$, the solution converges to a bistable periodic traveling wave directly connecting $\{u^+,u^-\}$ to $0$.}}{2}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fig1}{{1}{2}{Two distinct outcomes from step initial data connecting $u=u^+$ to $u=0$ plotted on even time steps $t \in \{0,2,4,...\}$. Left: with $a=0.1$, $r=0.23$, the solution converges to a stacked wave train consisting of a monostable $2$-periodic traveling wave connecting $\{u^+,u^-\}$ to $1$ followed by a monostable traveling wave connecting $1$ to $0$. Right: with $a=0.25$, $r=0.75$, the solution converges to a bistable periodic traveling wave directly connecting $\{u^+,u^-\}$ to $0$}{figure.caption.2}{}}
